        <p>No automated menus. No high-pressure sales. You'll talk to a real person who will listen first, then explain options that fit your situation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="expect-card">
        <div class="expect-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#c8900a" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
        </div>
